RodinHaptics
============

RodinHaptics is a rodin-specific Android vibrator HAL adaptation maintained by
NEESCHAL.

The implementation is derived from the Qualcomm / The Linux Foundation AIDL
vibrator service shipped for rodin. Original copyright and BSD-3-Clause terms
are retained in the source files.

No proprietary firmware, kernel object, vendor blob, or prebuilt binary is
included in this source release.
